    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d351">

                <pb facs="0457" n="375" sameAs="frus:frus1865p3/pg375"/>

                <head>Mr. Bigelow to Mr. Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 50.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Paris,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-03-10"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 10, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Referring to your despatch No. 48, relative
                    to the capture of the United States steamer Ark by rebel Texans in Mexican
                    waters when on a voyage from New Orleans to Matamoras, I have the honor to
                    enclose a communication which I made upon the subject to his excellency the
                    minister of foreign affairs yesterday.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, with great respect, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JOHN BIGELOW.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d351-a1.xml" xpointer="d351-a1"/>
